{"identifier":"Doctorin1946","title":"Doctor in Industry (Part I)","description":"Epic history of industrial medicine in the first half of the 20th century, showing how manufacturers and the medical profession came to terms with one another and culminating in GM's rehabilitation program for returned World War II veterans","videoUrl":"https://archive.org/download/Doctorin1946/Doctorin1946_512kb.mp4","thumbnailUrl":"https://archive.org/services/img/Doctorin1946","sourcePageUrl":"https://archive.org/details/Doctorin1946","durationMs":1126001,"level":"B1","topic":"Medicine: Industrial medicine;Medicine: Occupational health;World War II: Postwar issues","sourceCredit":"Source: Internet Archive — Doctor in Industry (Part I)","hasCaptions":true,"segments":[{"startMs":0,"endMs":21001,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":30000,"endMs":88001,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":116000,"endMs":116001,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":131001,"endMs":137000,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":140001,"endMs":143000,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":146001,"endMs":158000,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":176001,"endMs":181001,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":206001,"endMs":209001,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":246001,"endMs":257001,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":261000,"endMs":265000,"text":"9. 10."},{"startMs":281000,"endMs":288000,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":295000,"endMs":316000,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":326001,"endMs":350001,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":379000,"endMs":391000,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":422001,"endMs":424001,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":430000,"endMs":433000,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":449000,"endMs":451000,"text":"We can get there quicker if we cut across."},{"startMs":451001,"endMs":452000,"text":"We'll take that, Scott."},{"startMs":456001,"endMs":457001,"text":"All right."},{"startMs":462001,"endMs":487000,"text":"[...] lot, Scott."},{"startMs":487000,"endMs":489001,"text":"Using Joe in the back for her, disinfect."},{"startMs":491000,"endMs":492001,"text":"Sure, that's what we always do."},{"startMs":493000,"endMs":495001,"text":"Cobwebs for the bleeding and Joe in the back for disinfect."},{"startMs":496000,"endMs":497000,"text":"Here, let me in there."},{"startMs":497000,"endMs":498000,"text":"Yes, sir."},{"startMs":500001,"endMs":502000,"text":"We have to get this man to a hospital, quickly."},{"startMs":503001,"endMs":505000,"text":"Easy. Take it easy, man."},{"startMs":516000,"endMs":517000,"text":"Good morning, Dr. Randall."},{"startMs":517000,"endMs":518000,"text":"Good morning, Doctor."},{"startMs":519001,"endMs":521000,"text":"Good morning, Doctor."},{"startMs":521000,"endMs":521001,"text":"Good morning."},{"startMs":524001,"endMs":532000,"text":"This is your chart."},{"startMs":533000,"endMs":533001,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":533000,"endMs":535001,"text":"Does my son come in yet, Miss Lane?"},{"startMs":535001,"endMs":537000,"text":"No, he hasn't, Dr. Randall."},{"startMs":538000,"endMs":539000,"text":"Oh, here he is now."},{"startMs":540000,"endMs":541001,"text":"Good morning, Dad. Good morning, Miss Lane."},{"startMs":541001,"endMs":542000,"text":"Good morning."},{"startMs":542000,"endMs":545001,"text":"Say, Ken, I looked in on that new patient of yours just now."},{"startMs":546000,"endMs":547001,"text":"A fellow from the mill. I hope you don't mind."},{"startMs":548000,"endMs":549001,"text":"Gosh, no, Dad. What'd you think about him?"},{"startMs":549001,"endMs":551000,"text":"Looks like you're me all right."},{"startMs":551001,"endMs":553001,"text":"Husky fellow, you did a fine job."},{"startMs":554001,"endMs":555001,"text":"Splendid piece of surgery."},{"startMs":556001,"endMs":559000,"text":"Well, like father, like son."},{"startMs":559000,"endMs":560000,"text":"I hope, Dad."},{"startMs":560000,"endMs":562000,"text":"That'll take years of hard work."},{"startMs":563000,"endMs":567001,"text":"By the way, you'd better accustom yourself to addressing me as doctor, especially around the hospital."},{"startMs":568000,"endMs":569000,"text":"I'll do the same."},{"startMs":569000,"endMs":570000,"text":"Very well, Dad."},{"startMs":570001,"endMs":571000,"text":"Uh, doctor."},{"startMs":571001,"endMs":574001,"text":"Excuse me. Doctor would rule up this for you to look at before you leave."},{"startMs":577001,"endMs":584001,"text":"You know, I've been thinking."},{"startMs":585001,"endMs":588000,"text":"There are quite a number of accidents over there at the mill."},{"startMs":588000,"endMs":593000,"text":"I remember as a kid, you're always treating somebody from there, fixing a broken arm or something."},{"startMs":593001,"endMs":597000,"text":"Yes, my fees from that mill alone probably put you through medical school."},{"startMs":597001,"endMs":600000,"text":"I've been wondering if something could be done about that."},{"startMs":600000,"endMs":601001,"text":"The accidents of the mill, I mean."},{"startMs":602001,"endMs":604000,"text":"It seems to me that..."},{"startMs":604000,"endMs":606000,"text":"Well, my doubt, if anything can be done about it."},{"startMs":606001,"endMs":608001,"text":"There are always accidents, especially in a mill."},{"startMs":610000,"endMs":612001,"text":"Men grow careless. Something goes wrong with the machinery."},{"startMs":613000,"endMs":614001,"text":"Well, I don't know. It doesn't seem right to me."},{"startMs":615000,"endMs":620000,"text":"Isn't it part of a doctor's job to do everything he can to prevent accidents and sickness, as well as to cure them?"},{"startMs":621000,"endMs":623000,"text":"Of course. But within reason."},{"startMs":623001,"endMs":625001,"text":"You can't close every mill and factory in town."},{"startMs":626001,"endMs":630001,"text":"Now, you just concentrate on being a good surgeon, and don't worry about anything else."},{"startMs":631000,"endMs":633000,"text":"Dr. Randall, they're waiting for you in the operating room."},{"startMs":633000,"endMs":633001,"text":"Thank you."},{"startMs":634001,"endMs":635001,"text":"All went away."},{"startMs":636001,"endMs":638000,"text":"Tom Arthur, I'll be driving in for dinner tonight."},{"startMs":655000,"endMs":657000,"text":"The doctor will see you in just a moment."},{"startMs":658000,"endMs":660000,"text":"Mason, what's the matter with you fellows over there at the plant?"},{"startMs":661000,"endMs":664000,"text":"I thought I told you to come in and have this hand dressed every day."},{"startMs":665000,"endMs":666001,"text":"Johnson's as bad as you are."},{"startMs":667000,"endMs":668001,"text":"His wound should be dressed every day, too."},{"startMs":669000,"endMs":670001,"text":"Yet he hasn't been in for a week."},{"startMs":672000,"endMs":673001,"text":"Ah, you fellows at the plant are all alike."},{"startMs":674001,"endMs":676001,"text":"[...] trash doc. It ain't so easy."},{"startMs":677001,"endMs":679001,"text":"We work all day and at night."},{"startMs":680001,"endMs":687001,"text":"Well, it seems when we get home, get cleaned up and have our supper, I don't know."},{"startMs":688001,"endMs":691001,"text":"It seems there just ain't no time for running to the doctor."},{"startMs":695001,"endMs":699000,"text":"I have an idea."},{"startMs":700001,"endMs":702001,"text":"What time do you fellows quit for lunch?"},{"startMs":702001,"endMs":703001,"text":"About 11.30."},{"startMs":705000,"endMs":707001,"text":"Perhaps a few men can't find the time. Maybe I can."},{"startMs":708001,"endMs":711001,"text":"How would it be if I came into the plant tomorrow at 11.30?"},{"startMs":712000,"endMs":713000,"text":"Gee, do you think you could do that, doc?"},{"startMs":713001,"endMs":716001,"text":"Guys, if you can come over to the plant, that'll help things out a lot."},{"startMs":717001,"endMs":718000,"text":"All right."},{"startMs":733001,"endMs":738000,"text":"I'll take a look at it."},{"startMs":739000,"endMs":740001,"text":"Well, slip your shirt off, will you?"},{"startMs":744000,"endMs":745000,"text":"There you are, Jim."},{"startMs":745001,"endMs":746000,"text":"I thought I'd picked you up."},{"startMs":746001,"endMs":747001,"text":"Okay, doc. Thanks a lot."},{"startMs":752000,"endMs":752001,"text":"Thank you."},{"startMs":752001,"endMs":756001,"text":"Well, that's it. Now let's see."},{"startMs":758001,"endMs":759000,"text":"Where does it hurt?"},{"startMs":760001,"endMs":761000,"text":"Here?"},{"startMs":762001,"endMs":763001,"text":"Oh, it hurt you there, huh?"},{"startMs":765000,"endMs":766000,"text":"Do you do much lifting, Judd?"},{"startMs":767001,"endMs":769000,"text":"Most all the time, doc."},{"startMs":771000,"endMs":772001,"text":"You'd think I'd be used to it, wouldn't you?"},{"startMs":773000,"endMs":774001,"text":"How long has your back been hurting you?"},{"startMs":775000,"endMs":777000,"text":"Oh, for several months, off and on."},{"startMs":777000,"endMs":779000,"text":"But lately, it's been hurting most of the time."},{"startMs":780001,"endMs":782001,"text":"How about getting transferred to some other kind of job?"},{"startMs":783001,"endMs":784001,"text":"A job where you wouldn't have to do any lifting?"},{"startMs":785001,"endMs":787001,"text":"Why, I've had lifting jobs all the time."},{"startMs":787001,"endMs":790001,"text":"Well, if you keep on lifting, Judd, that pain, your back's going to get worse."},{"startMs":791001,"endMs":793001,"text":"You'll be laid up, maybe for a long time."},{"startMs":794001,"endMs":798000,"text":"Now, my advice is go see your family doctor as soon as you're through work this afternoon."},{"startMs":799001,"endMs":803001,"text":"Get him to give your back a thorough examination and see what he advises you to do."},{"startMs":806000,"endMs":811000,"text":"Well, all right if you say so, but I thought maybe you'd give me something to rub in and take the pain away."},{"startMs":811000,"endMs":812000,"text":"I wouldn't do any good, Judd."},{"startMs":813000,"endMs":814000,"text":"Now, don't put off seeing your doctor."},{"startMs":814001,"endMs":817001,"text":"Go see him as soon as you're through work today, will you?"},{"startMs":818001,"endMs":820000,"text":"Well, all right if you say so."},{"startMs":822000,"endMs":824000,"text":"Got a little cut in my arm, doc."},{"startMs":824001,"endMs":825000,"text":"Did it this morning."},{"startMs":825001,"endMs":828000,"text":"As long as you're going to be around here, I thought maybe you'd take a look at it."},{"startMs":828000,"endMs":828001,"text":"Mm-hmm."},{"startMs":829000,"endMs":829001,"text":"[...] pain in the much."},{"startMs":830000,"endMs":831001,"text":"This morning, huh?"},{"startMs":833000,"endMs":834001,"text":"Let's see here."},{"startMs":836001,"endMs":838001,"text":"Did you dress this yourself?"},{"startMs":842000,"endMs":843001,"text":"I see."},{"startMs":846000,"endMs":847001,"text":"Sit down here, Bill."},{"startMs":851000,"endMs":855001,"text":"Bill, you folks ought to have a first aid kit around here."},{"startMs":856000,"endMs":858000,"text":"Yeah, except we wouldn't know how to use it."},{"startMs":859001,"endMs":862001,"text":"Well, I'd be glad to teach somebody to give first aid treatment."},{"startMs":864000,"endMs":865001,"text":"I'm in handy in cases like this."},{"startMs":867000,"endMs":867001,"text":"Say, all right."},{"startMs":868001,"endMs":869000,"text":"Yeah, Bill?"},{"startMs":869001,"endMs":870001,"text":"Come on over here."},{"startMs":872000,"endMs":874000,"text":"Art's always around helping when anyone's hurt."},{"startMs":874001,"endMs":876001,"text":"He'd be a good one to teach first aid to."},{"startMs":878000,"endMs":879001,"text":"What's up?"},{"startMs":880000,"endMs":881000,"text":"Hello, Doc Randall."},{"startMs":882001,"endMs":884001,"text":"Doc here wants to know if you want to be his assistant."},{"startMs":886000,"endMs":890000,"text":"Bill suggested that you might be interested in learning a little about giving first aid."},{"startMs":890001,"endMs":891001,"text":"In cases like this."},{"startMs":892000,"endMs":893001,"text":"Yeah, that'd be all right."},{"startMs":894001,"endMs":895000,"text":"Well, fine."},{"startMs":896001,"endMs":900000,"text":"I'll leave some iodine and some bandages and a few..."},{"startMs":900000,"endMs":900001,"text":"See ya."},{"startMs":902001,"endMs":908001,"text":"How about putting stuff in here?"},{"startMs":908001,"endMs":909001,"text":"I don't use this box anymore."},{"startMs":910001,"endMs":912001,"text":"Yes, I make quite a medical department."},{"startMs":918000,"endMs":923000,"text":"One morning about three weeks later, Dr. Randall, Sr., was reading a newspaper."},{"startMs":924000,"endMs":926001,"text":"What he saw didn't exactly please him."},{"startMs":930000,"endMs":931000,"text":"Say, Ken."},{"startMs":932000,"endMs":932001,"text":"Oh, hello, Martha."},{"startMs":934000,"endMs":934001,"text":"Kenneth, listen to this."},{"startMs":935001,"endMs":937001,"text":"Work a threatened suit for alleged back injuries."},{"startMs":938001,"endMs":941000,"text":"Decision to sue based on diagnosis of Dr. Kenneth Randall."},{"startMs":942001,"endMs":944001,"text":"I hope you realize a thing like that can cause a [...] of pain."},{"startMs":944001,"endMs":946000,"text":"It doesn't cost us every good patient we have."},{"startMs":947000,"endMs":953001,"text":"I've spent years trying to build up a dignified and successful practice, and then you come along and get yourself mixed up in a thing like this."},{"startMs":955000,"endMs":956001,"text":"Son, I wish you hadn't done it."},{"startMs":956001,"endMs":958001,"text":"But, Dad, what would you have me do?"},{"startMs":959001,"endMs":962000,"text":"I suggested he see his own doctor and take his advice."},{"startMs":963000,"endMs":963001,"text":"Anything wrong with that?"},{"startMs":964000,"endMs":967001,"text":"What I mean is you should have stayed away from the factory in the first place."},{"startMs":967001,"endMs":972001,"text":"And, Kenneth, I'm going to seriously suggest that from now on, you do your practicing in this office."},{"startMs":972001,"endMs":976000,"text":"Or the hospital surgery. That's your number one responsibility."},{"startMs":977000,"endMs":979000,"text":"And stay away from factories."},{"startMs":980001,"endMs":982000,"text":"That's not the life for you."},{"startMs":983001,"endMs":985000,"text":"Martha, I'll drop in for dinner tonight."},{"startMs":985000,"endMs":986000,"text":"Oh, fine."},{"startMs":988001,"endMs":999000,"text":"Martha, I've always felt that for a man to be a success in his own eyes, he's got to be more than just a competent member of his profession."},{"startMs":999001,"endMs":1001001,"text":"I don't quite see what you're getting at."},{"startMs":1003001,"endMs":1016001,"text":"I mean, to be really successful, or maybe I should say worthy, a carpenter, a tool maker, engineer, preacher, or a doctor should contribute"},{"startMs":1016001,"endMs":1019001,"text":"something to the advancement of human progress through his profession."},{"startMs":1021000,"endMs":1024000,"text":"Maybe it's just finding new ways to make something better or cheaper."},{"startMs":1025001,"endMs":1030000,"text":"Maybe it's fighting and working unselfishly for a just cause."},{"startMs":1030001,"endMs":1033001,"text":"Can you sound just like a high school valedictorian?"},{"startMs":1035000,"endMs":1038000,"text":"Well, maybe so, but I mean it."},{"startMs":1038001,"endMs":1048001,"text":"And as far as I'm concerned, I'm beginning to think that my job is doing something for the advancement of a new kind of medical practice."},{"startMs":1048001,"endMs":1050001,"text":"You? In what way?"},{"startMs":1051000,"endMs":1059000,"text":"Well, new from the point of view of a doctor working to cut down sickness and accidents in the towns, factories, and mills."},{"startMs":1060001,"endMs":1067000,"text":"Yes, I suppose you could call it the practice of industrial medicine."},{"startMs":1068001,"endMs":1071000,"text":"But Ken, you know what your father will say."},{"startMs":1074001,"endMs":1078000,"text":"What's more important, Martha? What do you say?"},{"startMs":1078001,"endMs":1083001,"text":"All that I am or ever hope to be, I owe to my wife."},{"startMs":1085000,"endMs":1089001,"text":"In that case, I'd better do all I can to help in whatever job you undertake."},{"startMs":1090000,"endMs":1091001,"text":"How are you going to go about it?"},{"startMs":1091001,"endMs":1095000,"text":"Right now, I don't know. I really don't know."},{"startMs":1097000,"endMs":1098000,"text":"But I'm going to do something."},{"startMs":1102001,"endMs":1109001,"text":"Dr. and Mr. Gregg and I have been talking over the idea of your coming into the plant for a regular period each day."},{"startMs":1110001,"endMs":1116000,"text":"I must say the idea of a doctor in a factory seems quite unusual to me. To say the least."},{"startMs":1117000,"endMs":1118000,"text":"Sit down, Doctor."},{"startMs":1118001,"endMs":1124000,"text":"No, gentlemen, there's nothing new about a doctor in industry, and I've been interested in the idea for some time."},{"startMs":1124001,"endMs":1126001,"text":"So when you said you wanted to see me, I came right over."}]}